                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played the heck out of the demo, so of course I had to buy the full version. As it was in the demo, Pitch Hit is intuitive, simple, and fun. I could show this game to a non-gamer who hasn't tried VR yet, and they could get the hang of it easily.\n\nThere isn't a ton of content as of now, but this is the kind of game that I'll come back to every so often for 10 or 15 minutes  to get my VR baseball fix. My favorite mode is definitely playing catch with myself, which is way more fun than I thought it would be.",
